<title>USA: Nalco, Paper Chemicals Inc form alliance.</title>
<headline>Nalco, Paper Chemicals Inc form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nalco Chemical Co and Paper Chemicals Inc have formed an alliance to provide a broad range of specialty chemical products, services and systems for the pulp and paper industries, Nalco said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Nalco, a manufacturer of water treatment chemicals and services, will market Paper Chemicals Co's technology worldwide. Paper Chemicals is a major supplier of defoamers and other specialty chemicals for pulp mills.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
